# Reload from the quiver (reports/archery/2026-11-05-quiver-reload): the clips for the user and the rails. Onar's
# field, 16:00, the sun from the side; still cameras: the camera at -80 (in front on the right (the drawing hand, the quiver, the
# face), -140 the right side from behind (the quiver's turn, the draw past the flank). slowmo 4: three reloads a take;
# to 60 fps of game time: ffmpeg setpts=0.25*PTS (real time), 0.5*PTS (half speed).
# Content (OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT): the reload's clips T_BOWRELOADQ (scripts/content/anim/reload_quiver.py), the quiver's
# meshes and materials. Before | after: the same run with OPENGOTHIC_QUIVERRELOAD=0 (G2's reload) and `quiver lift
# off` for the fletching. TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1280x720, TIMEOUT=2400.
# Columns: rq_* (BowDraw: the points in the chest's frame, the hand, the forearm, the arrow out of the trunk and the
# tube, the arrow off the axis), qv_fletch, qv_line, qv_drawout, qv_lift (the quiver's lift); rails.py next to the
# report reads them.
cheat god
set time 16 0
view clean
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 90
wait 500
manual on
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
equip ITAR_Leather_L
arrows player 40
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1200 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
tap bow
cam look 120
wait 1500

# the length of the reload at x0.85 and x1.6 on each talent step (stats: reload ms)
stats str 30 dex 0 bow 10 talent 0
stats str 30 dex 150 bow 10 talent 0
stats str 60 dex 0 bow 40 talent 1
stats str 60 dex 150 bow 40 talent 1
stats str 120 dex 0 bow 100 talent 2
stats str 120 dex 150 bow 100 talent 2

# the fletching against the flank in the aim, the three steps: the lift off (as before) and on
cam follow 170 120 -80
quiver lift off
stats str 30 dex 10 bow 10 talent 0
volley 1 300
rec fletch_t0_off_fr
volley 1 1200
stop
cam follow 170 120 -140
rec fletch_t0_off_back
volley 1 1200
stop
quiver lift on
cam follow 170 120 -80
rec fletch_t0_on_fr
volley 1 1200
stop
cam follow 170 120 -140
rec fletch_t0_on_back
volley 1 1200
stop
stats str 60 dex 60 bow 40 talent 1
quiver lift off
volley 1 300
rec fletch_t1_off_back
volley 1 1200
stop
quiver lift on
rec fletch_t1_on_back
volley 1 1200
stop
stats str 120 dex 150 bow 100 talent 2
quiver lift off
volley 1 300
rec fletch_t2_off_back
volley 1 1200
stop
quiver lift on
rec fletch_t2_on_back
volley 1 1200
stop

# the slow archer (talent 0, dexterity 10) and the quick one (talent 2, dexterity 150), light leather
slowmo 4
stats str 30 dex 10 bow 10 talent 0
volley 1 300
cam follow 280 125 -80
rec slow_A
volley 3 300
wait 300
stop
cam follow 280 125 -140
rec slow_B
volley 3 300
wait 300
stop
stats str 120 dex 150 bow 100 talent 2
volley 1 300
cam follow 280 125 -80
rec fast_A
volley 3 300
wait 300
stop
cam follow 280 125 -140
rec fast_B
volley 3 300
wait 300
stop

# the quick archer in the bandit's, the militia's armour and the fire mage's robe
equip ITAR_BDT_H
volley 1 300
cam follow 280 125 -80
rec fast_bdt_A
volley 3 300
wait 300
stop
equip ITAR_MIL_M
volley 1 300
rec fast_mil_A
volley 3 300
wait 300
stop
equip ITAR_KDF_H
volley 1 300
rec fast_kdf_A
volley 3 300
wait 300
stop
equip ITAR_Leather_L

# down to the last arrow: the quiver shows fewer and none
arrows player 6
volley 1 300
cam follow 190 115 -140
rec last_arrows_B
volley 6 300
wait 600
stop
slowmo 1
arrows player 40

# an npc bowman aiming by hand (light leather), shooting at the peasant (pinned beside the hero, the peasant free)
insert BDT_1000_BANDIT_L
wait 300
immortal BDT_1000_BANDIT_L on
npcequip BDT_1000_BANDIT_L ItRw_Bow_L_01
npcequip BDT_1000_BANDIT_L ITAR_Leather_L
arrows BDT_1000_BANDIT_L 30
pin BDT_1000_BANDIT_L 500 -90 0
watch BDT_1000_BANDIT_L
archer BDT_1000_BANDIT_L at BAU_904_BAUER
wait 2500
slowmo 4
cam follow 280 125 -80
rec npc_A
wait 12000
stop
slowmo 1
archer off
